<title>JAPAN: Foreigners net seller of Japan stocks via 12 firms.</title>
<headline>Foreigners net seller of Japan stocks via 12 firms.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Orders placed by foreign investors through 12 foreign securities houses before the start of stock trading on Tuesday showed a net selling stance of 170,000 shares, market sources said.</p>
<p>Foreign investor buy orders totalled 27.30 million shares while sell orders amounted to 29.00 million shares.</p>
</text>
